            "description": "[https://gemini.google.com/share/56ab23476b50](https://gemini.google.com/share/56ab23476b50) \n\n[https://gemini.google.com/share/99f58855b146](https://gemini.google.com/share/99f58855b146) \n\n[https://docs.google.com/document/d/1WgktRlIGX9e81ViS1fPFsatheSjvlV0pse-Eq9TPqgs/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.tthykuc2gq7m](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1WgktRlIGX9e81ViS1fPFsatheSjvlV0pse-Eq9TPqgs/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.tthykuc2gq7m)\n\n\n\nFigma Link \u2013 [https://www.figma.com/design/kas5Sy2Eub0AMUXcPkOYvx/GST?node-id=3267-23466&t=qIe2gUv8FR7UDst8-0](https://www.figma.com/design/kas5Sy2Eub0AMUXcPkOYvx/GST?node-id=3267-23466&t=qIe2gUv8FR7UDst8-0) \n\nPRD \u2013 [https://docs.google.com/document/d/1WgktRlIGX9e81ViS1fPFsatheSjvlV0pse-Eq9TPqgs/edit?tab=t.vdihbco3cmez#heading=h.tthykuc2gq7m](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1WgktRlIGX9e81ViS1fPFsatheSjvlV0pse-Eq9TPqgs/edit?tab=t.vdihbco3cmez#heading=h.tthykuc2gq7m) (Final PRD)\n\n\nBackend Development SDD -  \n\n",
